coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder sharing remove [flags] <workspace> --user <user> --group <group>

  Remove shared access for users or groups from a workspace.

  Aliases: unshare, rm

OPTIONS:
      --group string-array
          A comma separated list of groups to remove from the workspace.

      --user string-array
          A comma separated list of users to remove from the workspace.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
